<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Berzacks-Illman ups interim shr, div.</title>
<headline>Berzacks-Illman ups interim shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - headline		 51.4	vs     46.2</p>
<p>    - attrib		   51.7	vs     46.2</p>
